%% Reprise IDE - opening the IDE, the folder and the runner (v3)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Developer
    participant B as Reprise IDE tab
    participant F as Local folder
    participant R as Reprise Runner
    participant G as GitHub

    U->>B: open https://OWNER.github.io/reprise-ide/ide/
    B->>B: check showDirectoryPicker exists, else unsupported-browser page
    U->>B: Open Folder
    B->>F: showDirectoryPicker, user grants read and write
    B->>F: read .git/config and .git/HEAD
    U->>B: sign in (token)
    B->>G: check token, link owner/repo from origin remote
    U->>R: node reprise-runner.mjs --root path/to/clone
    R-->>U: prints port and one-time pairing code
    U->>B: Reprise: Connect Runner (port, code)
    B->>R: POST /pair with code
    R->>R: check Origin against allow-list, code unused and unexpired
    R-->>B: session token, remote URL, HEAD SHA, platforms available
    B->>B: compare remote and HEAD with the opened folder
    alt same repository
        B-->>U: Runner connected, status bar shows platforms
    else mismatch
        B-->>U: Runner root is a different repository, refuse
    end
